{"product_id":"the-abominators-and-the-forces-of-evil","title":"The Abominators And The Forces Of Evil","description":"\u003cp\u003eMucker, Boogster, Cheesy and Bob are THE ABOMINATORSThey're learning to live with posh boy Cecil and his panty wanty woos. If you put them under pressure, they might even say he's part of the gang.But then the Forces of Evil turn up in the shape of two VERY mean teachers. They've got plans for Cecil. Plans which involve fear, destruction and possibly the end of the world!Can the Abominators save Cecil from a fate worse than detention?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: J.L. Smith\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781907411649\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738324459673,"sku":"16RA-1-9781907411649","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d1494a06f4e_The_Abominators_And_The_Forces_Of_Evil_J.L._Smith.jpg?v=1758564067","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-abominators-and-the-forces-of-evil","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}